 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 515593,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "At  a charity event with 58 people in attendance, 3 raffle winners are chosen. All receive the same prize, so order doesn’t matter. How many different groups of 3 winners can be chosen?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Since they all receive the same prize, it does not matter what order they call the names. This is a combination, choosing 3 names from 58.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"58C3 = \\frac{{n!}}{{r!\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{58!}}{{3!\\left( {58 - 3} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{58!}}{{3!55!}} = \\frac{{58 \\times 57 \\times 56 \\times \\cancel{{55!}}}}{{3 \\times 2 \\times 1 \\times \\cancel{{55!}}}} = \\frac{{185,136}}{6} = 30,856\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "30,856"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 515594,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A  sorority with 42 members needs to choose a committee with 4 members, each with equal responsibility. How many committees are possible?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Since they all have equal responsibility, it does not matter in which order you name the members. This is a combination, choosing 4 members from 42 members.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"42C4 = \\frac{{n!}}{{r!\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{42!}}{{4!\\left( {42 - 4} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{42!}}{{4!38!}} = \\frac{{42 \\times 41 \\times 40 \\times 39 \\times \\cancel{{38!}}}}{{4 \\times 3 \\times 2 \\times 1 \\times \\cancel{{38!}}}} = \\frac{{2,686,320}}{{24}} = 111,930\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "111,930"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
